# Package-discovery caches: regenerated by composer install / package:discover
# from whatever vendor/ is actually present, so a committed copy only ever
# describes the machine that last ran it (Laravel rebuilds them if absent).
# NOTE: main carried a blanket `bootstrap/` here. It is deliberately NOT kept.
# It would cover bootstrap/app.php and bootstrap/providers.php, which are
# source, and bootstrap/cache/.gitignore, which this release tracks on purpose
# as the keeper that makes the directory survive a clean checkout. The two
# explicit entries below are that rule stated exactly (PR #317 F-016).
/bootstrap/cache/packages.php
/bootstrap/cache/services.php
